{"id":"bda18e5a40f416fb","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-thm-hardy-littlewood.md","title":"von Koch Criterion for RH","display":"thm-hardy-littlewood — von Koch Criterion for RH","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-hardy-littlewood","aliases":["58-thm-hardy-littlewood"],"display":"thm-hardy-littlewood — von Koch Criterion for RH","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zeta-function.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[58-df-signed-integral-data.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-hardy-littlewood"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-hardy-littlewood</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hardy-littlewood — von Koch Criterion for RH"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dad686059f3ca152\" href=\"?note=dad686059f3ca152\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md\">../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bd554d3da5a43116\" href=\"?note=bd554d3da5a43116\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zeta-function.md\">../batch15/58-df-zeta-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" href=\"?note=76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" title=\"58-df-signed-integral-data.md\">58-df-signed-integral-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"68427bc628af9b8d\" href=\"?note=68427bc628af9b8d\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md\">../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\zeta,\\pi,\\operatorname{Li}\\in V\">\\(\\zeta,\\pi,\\operatorname{Li}\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZetaFunction}_S(\\zeta)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZetaFunction}_S(\\zeta)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prime}(p)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prime}(p)\\)</span> 分别是 Riemann zeta 函数和素数谓词</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RiemannHypothesis}_S\\subseteq V^1\">\\(\\mathrm{RiemannHypothesis}_S\\subseteq V^1\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimeCounting}_S\\subseteq V^1\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimeCounting}_S\\subseteq V^1\\)</span> 是本文件定义的谓词</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LogarithmicIntegral}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\operatorname{Li})\">\\(\\mathrm{LogarithmicIntegral}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\operatorname{Li})\\)</span> 由下式定义，定义域保持为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R_{&gt;2}\">\\(\\mathbb R_{&gt;2}\\)</span>，归一化保持积分下限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2\">\\(2\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasure}_S(\\lambda,\\mathcal L,\\mathbb R)\">\\(\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasure}_S(\\lambda,\\mathcal L,\\mathbb R)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{[2,x]}=\\{A\\cap[2,x]:A\\in\\mathcal L\\}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{[2,x]}=\\{A\\cap[2,x]:A\\in\\mathcal L\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda_{[2,x]}=\\lambda\\upharpoonright\\mathcal L_{[2,x]}\">\\(\\lambda_{[2,x]}=\\lambda\\upharpoonright\\mathcal L_{[2,x]}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VonKochEstimate}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\pi,\\operatorname{Li})\">\\(\\mathrm{VonKochEstimate}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\pi,\\operatorname{Li})\\)</span> 是本文件以下式固定的渐近估计</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}\">\\(\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" href=\"?note=76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" title=\"58-df-signed-integral-data.md\">58-df-signed-integral-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LogarithmicIntegral}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\operatorname{Li})\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{Li},\\mathbb R_{&gt;2},\\mathbb R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;2}\\;\n\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}_S\\left(\\operatorname{Li}(x),\n\\{\\langle t,1/\\log t\\rangle:t\\in[2,x]\\},\n[2,x],\\mathcal L_{[2,x]},\\lambda_{[2,x]}\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LogarithmicIntegral}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\operatorname{Li})\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{Li},\\mathbb R_{&gt;2},\\mathbb R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;2}\\;\n\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}_S\\left(\\operatorname{Li}(x),\n\\{\\langle t,1/\\log t\\rangle:t\\in[2,x]\\},\n[2,x],\\mathcal L_{[2,x]},\\lambda_{[2,x]}\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}riemann\\text{-}hypothesis}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RiemannHypothesis}_S(\\zeta)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZetaFunction}_S(\\zeta)\\land\n\\forall z\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\zeta)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\zeta(z)=0\\land0&lt;\\operatorname{Re}(z)&lt;1\n\\to\\operatorname{Re}(z)=\\tfrac12\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}riemann\\text{-}hypothesis}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RiemannHypothesis}_S(\\zeta)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZetaFunction}_S(\\zeta)\\land\n\\forall z\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\zeta)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\zeta(z)=0\\land0&lt;\\operatorname{Re}(z)&lt;1\n\\to\\operatorname{Re}(z)=\\tfrac12\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prime\\text{-}counting}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PrimeCounting}_S(\\pi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\omega)\\land\n\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\left(\n\\pi(x)=\\left|\\{p\\in\\omega:\\mathrm{Prime}(p)\\land p\\leq x\\}\\right|\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prime\\text{-}counting}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PrimeCounting}_S(\\pi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\omega)\\land\n\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\left(\n\\pi(x)=\\left|\\{p\\in\\omega:\\mathrm{Prime}(p)\\land p\\leq x\\}\\right|\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}von\\text{-}koch\\text{-}estimate}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{VonKochEstimate}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\pi,\\operatorname{Li})\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists x_0\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;2}\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(\nx\\geq x_0\\to\n|\\pi(x)-\\operatorname{Li}(x)|\\leq C\\sqrt x\\log x\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}von\\text{-}koch\\text{-}estimate}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{VonKochEstimate}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\pi,\\operatorname{Li})\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists x_0\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;2}\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(\nx\\geq x_0\\to\n|\\pi(x)-\\operatorname{Li}(x)|\\leq C\\sqrt x\\log x\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hardy\\text{-}littlewood}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZetaFunction}_S(\\zeta)\n\\land\\mathrm{PrimeCounting}_S(\\pi)\n\\land\\mathrm{LogarithmicIntegral}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\operatorname{Li})\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RiemannHypothesis}_S(\\zeta)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{VonKochEstimate}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\pi,\\operatorname{Li})\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hardy\\text{-}littlewood}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZetaFunction}_S(\\zeta)\n\\land\\mathrm{PrimeCounting}_S(\\pi)\n\\land\\mathrm{LogarithmicIntegral}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\operatorname{Li})\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RiemannHypothesis}_S(\\zeta)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{VonKochEstimate}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\pi,\\operatorname{Li})\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>文件名、标签及接口沿用原文件；内容仍是原有的 von Koch 型 RH 等价判据。对数积分的归一化没有改成从 0 起算的主值积分。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md","status":"resolved","id":"dad686059f3ca152","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zeta-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bd554d3da5a43116","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zeta-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"5